flowchart TD
  A[Text or printed prescription photo] --> B[Local structured OCR / text spans]
  B --> C[Offline terminology and ingredient candidates]
  C --> D{Identity resolved?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Deterministic ingredient-pair screening]
  D -->|No| F[Unassessed entries and candidate previews]
  F --> G[Prioritize review by possible finding changes]
  G --> H[Reviewer confirms / corrects / excludes non-medication text]
  H --> E
  H --> G
  I[Versioned DDInter / curated food rules] --> E
  E --> J[Source-linked findings and coverage]
  K[Explicit optional openFDA / PubChem retrieval] --> J
  J --> P[Typed evidence graph: mentions / ingredients / findings / passages / documents]
  C --> P
  H --> P
  P --> Q[Provenance / candidate hypotheses / correction and version-change queries]
  P --> L[Deterministic explanation / optional validated excerpts]
  Q --> M
  L --> M[Review desk / graph / HTML / replay JSON]
  C --> N[Offline evaluation with frozen data and code]
  G --> N
  N --> O[Metrics / paired group intervals / tables / figures]
